── outcome in the wrong case
exit 2
feov-record: bench: record: outcome requires --as VERIFIED|CEILING|HALTED|UNVERIFIED (got "ceiling") — "ceiling" differs from "CEILING" only in case, and the report's verdict stamp switches on this word — an unrecognized one falls through to a bare stamp, so a lowercase CEILING loses the "this is NOT a judged failure to verify" caveat the stamp exists to carry

